OL,3,GNEWSAAlcohol licence refused for
OL,4,Achild's first birthday party
OL,5,Acelebration
OL,6,
OL,7,FA bid to serve alcohol at a child's
OL,8,Ffirst birthday party in South Ayrshire
OL,9,Fhas been refused.
OL,11,FThe applicant claimed that families had
OL,12,Fbeen requesting licensed events as an
OL,13,Falternative to christening celebrations
OL,14,Fwhere a paid-for bar has been permitted
OL,15,Fin the past.
OL,17,FHowever, councillors and local
OL,18,Fauthority officers questioned the
OL,19,Fcomparison between such an event and a
OL,20,Fchildren's party with entertainment on
OL,21,Foffer.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
